	(text "Lead-acid string balancer, 2:1 switched capacitor, 2-4 x 12 V (rev A)\nBoards: main: input, ch1, ch2, ch3, alarm, mech; off: harness\nDomains: B1 (battery, 0 V = TAP0); B2 (battery, 0 V = TAP1); B3 (battery, 0 V = TAP2); B4 (battery, 0 V = TAP3); ISO (selv, 0 V = ALM_E); CH1_SPAN\n    (battery, 0 V = TAP0); CH1_HSU (battery, 0 V = ch1/CH1_X); CH1_HSL (battery, 0 V = ch1/CH1_Y); CH1_QFB (battery, 0 V = ch1/CH1_V5); CH1_LS\n    (battery, 0 V = TAP2); CH2_SPAN (battery, 0 V = TAP1); CH2_HSU (battery, 0 V = ch2/CH2_X); CH2_HSL (battery, 0 V = ch2/CH2_Y); CH2_QFB (battery, 0\n    V = ch2/CH2_V5); CH2_LS (battery, 0 V = TAP3); CH3_SPAN (battery, 0 V = TAP2); CH3_HSU (battery, 0 V = ch3/CH3_X); CH3_HSL (battery, 0 V =\n    ch3/CH3_Y); CH3_QFB (battery, 0 V = ch3/CH3_V5); CH3_LS (battery, 0 V = TAP4)\nBarrier B1/B2: functional, 49.7 V working, creepage 0.6 mm, clearance 0.6 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2 (external, uncoated))\nBarrier B2/B3: functional, 49.7 V working, creepage 0.6 mm, clearance 0.6 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2 (external, uncoated))\nBarrier B3/B4: functional, 49.7 V working, creepage 0.6 mm, clearance 0.6 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2 (external, uncoated))\nBarrier B1/B3: functional, 67.3 V working, creepage 1.5 mm, clearance 1 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2 (external, uncoated); IEC 60664-1 Table F.4 PD2 MG\n    IIIa (SLUP419 in repo for 63 V: 1.25 mm [P]; 80-100 V 1.3-1.4 mm [S]))\nBarrier B2/B4: functional, 67.3 V working, creepage 1.5 mm, clearance 1 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2 (external, uncoated); IEC 60664-1 Table F.4 PD2 MG\n    IIIa (SLUP419 in repo for 63 V: 1.25 mm [P]; 80-100 V 1.3-1.4 mm [S]))\nBarrier B1/B4: functional, 84.9 V working, creepage 1.5 mm, clearance 1 mm (IPC-2221B Table 6-1 B2 (external, uncoated); IEC 60664-1 Table F.4 PD2 MG\n    IIIa (SLUP419 in repo for 63 V: 1.25 mm [P]; 80-100 V 1.3-1.4 mm [S]))\nBarrier ISO/B1: basic, 185 V working, creepage 4 mm, clearance 4 mm (IEC 62368-1 ES2 to ES1 basic; IEC 60664-1 F.4 / F.2)\nNOT READY FOR FABRICATION — blocking questions: Q-1, Q-2, Q-4, Q-5, Q-12"
